@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra dich vu -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao luot nop hop le -> 201 Created + Location + received
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 4. Doc lai luot nop -> 200; received -> processing -> graded
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Thieu du lieu -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 7. Luot nop rong/khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bat tay SignalR -> 200 OK + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai duong dan hub -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
